# Nodes: id [size] [shape] [color] [text...]
idea circle yellow Idea
code square blue Write a scene
preview circle green Preview
share diamond purple Share link
qr hex orange QR code

# Edges: from -> to [style] [color] [text...]
idea -> code solid teal Type
code -> preview solid teal Render
preview -> code dashed orange Tweak
preview -> share solid purple Save
share -> qr dotted purple Scan
